    "title": "Senior React / Next.js Developer for Premium E-commerce Website",
    "ciphertext": "~022078678137029890503",
    "description": "Senior Full-Stack Developer Needed to Build a Premium Custom E-commerce Website\n\nI'm looking for an experienced full-stack developer to build a premium e-commerce website from an existing Figma design.\n\nThe UI/UX has already been designed, so I'm looking for someone who can accurately translate the designs into a fast, responsive and high-quality website with clean, scalable code.\n\nThis is an exciting opportunity to work on a premium wellness brand. The initial project is to deliver the first version of the website, with the potential for ongoing work as the platform evolves.\n\nScope of work\n\n• Build the website from existing Figma designs\n• Responsive development for desktop, tablet and mobile\n• Product catalogue\n• Shopping cart and checkout\n• Payment gateway integration\n• CMS for managing products and content\n• Optimise for speed, performance and SEO\n• Clean, maintainable and well-structured code\n\nPreferred experience\n\nIdeally you'll have experience with:\n\n• React\n• Next.js (or an alternative you recommend)\n• Node.js\n• TypeScript\n• API integrations\n• Custom e-commerce development\n\nI'm open to your recommendations on the best technology stack if you believe there's a better solution.\n\nPlease include in your proposal\n\n• Links to a few premium websites you've built\n• Examples of projects developed from Figma designs\n• The technology stack you would recommend and why\n• An estimated timeframe\n• Any questions or suggestions you have after reading this brief\n\nI'm looking for someone who communicates well, pays close attention to detail, writes high-quality code and is interested in building a long-term working relationship.",
